==Strategy==
The final stage of the [[Truth in Extremes|sub-chapter]] sees the first appearance of Puffsley's Comet in [[Zero Legends]] and with him, a Mr. Puffington which together, can prove to be a deadly combination. [[Idi:N (Special Cat)|Idi:N2]] can quickly dispose of Mr. Puffington, but Puffsley's Comet is a tougher challenge. Use cats with high damage per hit like [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]] to lower the number of attacks he lands. [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Pizza Cat]] should be used for the Shadow Boxer Ks and for extra chipping damage to Puffsley's Comet, while [[Ancient Egg: N004 (Special Cat)|Supercar Cat]] should be used for the Ackeys.

==='''Recommended Ubers'''===
*[[Baby Cat (Uber Rare Cat)|Cats in the Cradle]]: He is amazing on this stage, with high bulk and powerful Wave Attacks. Just send him out and he'll deal insane amounts of damage while not being juggled. A small bonus worth mentioning is his Immunity to Freeze, as he won't be frozen by the Ackeys.
*[[Lesser Demon Cat (Uber Rare Cat)|Greater Balrog Cat]]: Balrog, of course, is amazing on this stage. Just be sure not to send him out 1v1 against the Mega Baas, as they will juggle him. As you would with any other melee attackers, use [[Ototo Corps#Thunderbolt|Thunderbolt]] to Freeze whatever enemy he's about to get hit. Specifically, it'd be preferrable to save it for when he was his Strengthen active, as just one hit will do a significant chunk of either boss' health pool.
*[[Daybreaker Izanagi (Legend Rare Cat)|Dawnbringer Izanagi]]: Izanagi basically destroys this stage, having insane Single Attack damage while also having good piercing range and Freeze Immunity. The only enemy he struggles with is Mega Baa, as it is Traitless.

==Trivia==
*[[Puffsley's Comet]] and [[Mr. Puffington]] are here for the sake of a pun that was lost in translation. In Japanese, the stage's name is Sareki o Gyūjiru Fugū na Mono (砂礫を牛耳る不遇な者, "The Unfortunate One Ruling Over Pebbles"); the joke is that 不遇 ''fugū'' (misfortune) sounds almost like 河豚 ''fugu'' (pufferfish).

